<title>CANADA: Cascade to manage Abraxas assets.</title>
<headline>Cascade to manage Abraxas assets.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cascade Oil &amp; Gas Ltd said on Friday it will manage the Canadian operations that Abraxas Petroleum Corp said earlier today it will acquire from Canadian Gas Gathering Systems Inc.</p>
<p>Abraxas said earlier it has tentatively agreed to acquire CGGS for about US$85 million.</p>
<p>&quot;Cascade will have the option to acquire up to 10 percent of the interest acquired in the properties,&quot; Cascades said.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
